        "full_width": true,
        "show_space": false,
        "code": "<!-- SPORTS CAVE • Section Heading (overlays other sections) -->\n<div class=\"sc-heading v1 sc-heading--pullup sc-heading--overlay\" aria-label=\"Section heading\">\n  <h2 class=\"sc-heading__title\">The Ultimate Gift for Sports Fans</h2>\n</div>\n\n<style>\n  .sc-heading.v1{\n    --gold1:#976C1D;     \n    --gold2:#F7A007;     \n    --ink:#0D0D0D;\n    font-family:var(--sc-font-ui);\n\n    max-width:1200px; width:100%;\n    margin:0 auto; padding:0 14px;         \n    text-align:center; isolation:isolate; contain:content;\n    overflow:visible;                        \n  }\n\n  \n  .sc-heading--pullup{ padding-top:10px; margin-bottom:-30px; }\n\n  \n  .sc-heading--overlay{\n    position:relative;\n    z-index:99;            \n    margin-top:-6px;       \n    pointer-events:none;   \n  }\n  .sc-heading--overlay .sc-heading__title{ pointer-events:auto; } \n\n  .sc-heading__title{\n    margin:0;\n    color:var(--ink);\n    font-weight:700;\n    line-height:1.05;\n    letter-spacing:.01em;\n    font-size:clamp(28px,4.2vw,44px);\n    position:relative;\n    display:inline-block;\n  }\n  .sc-heading__title::after{\n    content:\"\";\n    display:block;\n    width:140px; height:6px;\n    margin:12px auto 0;\n    border-radius:999px;\n    background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--gold1),var(--gold2));\n    box-shadow:0 1px 3px rgba(247,160,7,.28);\n  }\n\n  @media (max-width:380px){\n    .sc-heading__title{ font-size:clamp(22px,6vw,28px); }\n  }\n</style>"
